[Music]  hi i'm rio  i'm the owner of kim's champion repair  and also i'm running on youtube channel  repair studio  today i'm doing a restoration on a pair  of gucci ace sneakers  that retail for around 680 dollars  these issues were brought by one of my  clients unfortunately  they were not maintained well there are  three main things to be restored  first of all the rubber stores are  stained so they  need to be removed second leather upper  gets  scuffed so they need to be re painted  and be finished  lastly metallic painter at the back  is faded so it needs to be retouched  [Music]  i'm taking off the shoe races and  insource from the shoes  [Music]  now i'm using a toothbrush to remove the  dust  from the inside of the shoes before  cleaning  because this dust or sand can cause some  scratches on leather  while i'm cleaning  i'm using a leather cleaner with a soft  hair brush  and gently moving the brush in a  circular motion to clean  the interior and exterior of the shoes  [Music]  now i'm wiping off the foam and water  quickly  to avoid any water damage  [Music]  [Music]  the rubber swords are dirty and stained  so i'm brushing them to clean out the  dirt  first and using a thinner scrubbing  off the stain with leg  metallic green panel is originally made  of leather  and printed with a metallic snake skin  shape  layer when people try to wear the shoes  they tend to touch or and bend the heel  area  i'm using a leather glue with on oil to  glue the peeled metallic back on  it's very hard to find the exactly same  paint color  to match the green metallic planner  since it's not  even one solid color i have to mix  several  paint colors to make the light and shade  of metallic painter  [Music]  the exterior of the shoes are scuffed  and discolored some areas  so i'm using a leather paint to touch up  the scuffed area first  and applying evenly all over the shoes  i'm using a matte finisher to protect  the paint  from peeling off or cracks  shoe races are not clean over like the  original condition  so i'm replacing with the new ones  now i'm applying shoe deodolizer to  eliminate  odor and keep fresh  [Music]  i'm very excited for my client to see  this installation  you

